Valyu Research - licensing scope

Except for third-party material and the exceptions below, the project
contributors license this collection as follows:

1. Software, Lean source, verification programs, build scripts and their
   executable configuration: Apache License, Version 2.0.
   Full text: LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt

2. Papers and manuscript source, documentation, original data and records,
   illustrations, narration and videos: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
   International (CC BY 4.0).
   Full text: LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt

These grants apply only to rights the contributors hold. Mathematical facts,
ideas and results are not made proprietary by this notice. The licenses do
not grant rights to third-party works merely cited in the papers, and they
do not imply that the cited authors endorse this collection.

Exceptions and third-party terms

* The Bašić-derived patch coordinates in
  maths/geometry/tilings/marked-polyform-heesch-numbers/verification/basic/
  (basic_patch.json, basic_patch_grid.json and basic_tile.json) are under
  CC BY-SA 4.0. The generated video/geometry.json and rendered visual assets in that package's video/ directory,
  including the complete video.mp4, are also distributed under CC BY-SA 4.0
  to preserve ShareAlike for the adapted patch illustrations. The package's
  programming source remains Apache-2.0. Attribution and changes are recorded
  in verification/basic/NOTICE.md. Full text: LICENSES/CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt
* Other third-party data and dependencies retain their original terms.
  See NOTICE and public-release/THIRD_PARTY.md for attribution and scope.
* The promoter-annotation tables excluded from this release are not licensed
  or distributed by this project. A retrieval script is supplied separately.

For attribution, cite the author and title of the relevant paper, retain
third-party notices, link to this repository and the applicable license,
and indicate your changes. CITATION.cff provides collection metadata.

